<title>JAPAN: MOF says plans to auction 6-mth T-bills on Monday.</title>
<headline>MOF says plans to auction 6-mth T-bills on Monday.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Ministry of Finance (MOF) plans to hold an auction for six-month Treasury bills (T-bills) on Monday, a MOF official said on Friday.</p>
<p>Bond traders said the volume of the offer is likely to be 1.5 trillion yen, the same volume of six-month T-bills maturing on April 10.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-33432-8570</p>
